# ShopMyUniform — MERN + AI Support Agent

## Technology Stack
- Frontend: React (Vite)
- Backend: Node.js + Express
- Database: MongoDB (Atlas)
- AI: OpenAI API (integration pending)

## Setup Instructions (backend)
cd backend
npm install
# create a .env file (see Environment Variables below)
npm run dev

## Environment Variables (backend/.env)
PORT=5000
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_atlas_connection_string
JWT_SECRET=any_long_random_string
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_key

## Database Structure
- School: name, city, grades[]
- User: name, email, password (hashed), role, studentName, grade, school (ref), phone, address
- Product: name, description, category, color, gender, school (ref), applicableGrades[], price, images[], sizes[{size, stock}], isActive
- Order: user (ref), items[{product (ref), name, size, quantity, price}], totalAmount, shippingAddress, status, statusHistory[{status, date, note}], estimatedDelivery, paymentMethod

## API Endpoints
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/auth/register | — | Register a new account |
| POST | /api/auth/login | — | Login, returns JWT |
| GET | /api/auth/profile | ✅ | Get logged-in user's profile |
| PUT | /api/auth/profile | ✅ | Update profile |

